  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Response to Food Crisis Caused by El Nio and Promotion of Climate-Smart Agriculture and Social Integration for Resilience Enhancement in Chiredzi District, Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local residents, including returnees, receive emergency food assistance, Local residents, including returnees, participate in economic empowerment training, Local farmers receive training on climate-smart agricultural practices, Local residents, including returnees, receive training on low cost sustainable water production and renewable energy adoption, Returnees participate in peacebuilding and social integration dialogues</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the project aims to enable the residents of Chiredzi District to build long-term resilience and secure a path toward sustainable development1. &#xadc0;&#xd658;&#xbbfc; &#xc218;&#xc6a9; &#xac00;&#xad6c;&#xc640; &#xc218;&#xc6a9;&#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4; &#xac00;&#xad6c;&#xc758; &#xc2dd;&#xb7c9; &#xbc0f; &#xc601;&#xc591; &#xd544;&#xc694;&#xb7c9;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131;&#xc774; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;&#xb428;
2. &#xadc0;&#xd658;&#xbbfc;, &#xd2b9;&#xd788; &#xccad;&#xb144; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;(60%)&#xacfc; &#xc218;&#xc6a9;&#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4;&#xac00; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654;&#xc5d0; &#xc801;&#xc751;&#xd558;&#xc5ec; &#xd68c;&#xbcf5;&#xb825; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xc0dd;&#xacc4; &#xc804;&#xb7b5;&#xc744; &#xad6c;&#xcd95;&#xd568;
